Z||000003||Chris McDonald||02-02-2001||04:32 PM||||[QUOTE]Originally posted by COUNTIBLIS:<BR>[B]Who all has a 3.1 or built a 3.1 here and is driving around in their FIERO?  <P>I built one in 1994.<P>3.1 block from a Lumina<BR>Crane 2040 Compu cam<BR>1.6 ratio rockers<BR>ported and polished Fiero 2.8 heads<BR>hyperutectic (spelling) pistons<BR>ported Fiero 2.8 intake<BR>high pressure regulator<BR>free flow exhaust<BR>JET computer chip<BR>2900 stall converter from the 1.8 liter Sunbird.<P>It ran very nice.  I went from 17 in the 1/4 mile to 15's and 8 to 10 mph increase in top speed in the qtr.  It was every bit as fast or faster than a typical Z28 or mustang in the 60 foot and 1/8 mile times.<P>Good luck on yours.<BR>||||reg||1
